SUMMARY:Submit CLA lawyer request + call the LA office
DESCRIPTION:SCHEDULED: <2026-08-27 Thu> *Form submitted [2026-08-27 Thu].* 
 Matter\ntype: Copyright Dispute/Infringement. The intake walks the statuto
 ry\nfair-use factors — purpose and character\, nature of the work\, amount
 \nused — plus a rights-holder-oriented field that had to be answered by\nn
 oting the direction is reversed. Answers as submitted are recorded\nbelow.
   *Still open: the phone call to 310-207-0001* to ask actual\nturnaround —
  the form alone gives no ETA.\n:EFFORT: 20m\nForm at `calawyersforthearts.
 org/lris-cla/'\, then call *310-207-0001*\nto ask their actual turnaround 
 — the form alone gives no ETA. Say it\nis a copyright/fair-use opinion plu
 s a presenter-warranty read\, and\nthat a venue is already circling. *Ask 
 whether the free 30 minutes can\nbe with someone who has written a fair-us
 e opinion letter*\; do not\naccept a general IP match.
CATEGORIES:cal,org-calendar-staging
END:VEVENT
